            &amp;lt;span class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[10px] text-emerald-300"&amp;gt;
              &amp;lt;i class="fa-solid fa-book-open-reader mr-1"&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/i&amp;gt;Daftar Putar Murotal Al-Qur’an (Mendukung Link YouTube &amp;amp;amp; MP3)
